  "families": {
    "bolt": "A glowing missile with a trail streaks from the caster's hand to each target and bursts on it; with an attack roll one flies per roll and a miss sails past.",
    "ray": "A thin, straight ray of the flavour's light joins hand and target for an instant, one per attack roll.",
    "beam": "A crackling beam joins the caster's hand to the target for a moment, one per attack roll, and flares where it lands; a chain jumps on from target to target.",
    "shot": "An arrow, bolt or thrown stone: a bright streak with a short trail and a small burst on the hit.",
    "touch": "The caster's hand flares and the touch lands in a tight burst of the flavour's light.",
    "drain": "A thin ray reaches the victim and its life streams back along it into the caster.",
    "burst": "A bright bead streaks to the point and explodes: a churning ball of the flavour's fire the size of the area, a shockwave across the floor, sparks and smoke.",
    "cone": "Flame, frost, light or force rushes from the caster's hands and fans out over the cone.",
    "line": "A forked lightning bolt, or a wide rushing beam of light or wind, along the line from the caster.",
    "nova": "A shockwave bursts out of the caster over the area: a ring racing across the floor, a shell of light, sparks flung out.",
    "strike": "Something comes down from the sky on the area or each target: a pillar of light or flame, a lightning bolt, hail.",
    "cloud": "A cloud billows out over the squares and settles into the lingering area the field shows.",
    "wall": "A wall rises along its squares: a sheet of fire, force, stone or ice climbing out of the floor.",
    "ground": "The ground erupts over the squares: vines, spikes, tentacles or webbing thrown up, dust and a circle of glyphs.",
    "aura": "An aura settles round the caster: a circle of glyphs opening to the area's edge, motes circling, a soft glow.",
    "heal": "Warm light wells up round each creature healed: a soft shaft, motes rising and a circle of light at its feet.",
    "buff": "A blessing: a circle of glyphs at the creature's feet, glints spiralling up round it and a crown of light overhead.",
    "debuff": "A curse settles on the creature: dark wisps sinking onto it from above and a band of light closing round its feet.",
    "psychic": "Rings of the flavour's light ripple in round the creature's head, with glints and a pulse of light.",
    "ward": "A bubble of the flavour's light pops into place round the creature and fades, glints on its skin.",
    "smite": "The blow lands in a flare of the flavour's light: a shaft strikes down on the target, sparks fly and a ring races across the floor.",
    "summon": "A circle of glyphs opens where the creature or thing appears, light rising from it and a flash.",
    "teleport": "Mist and glints burst where the creature was and where it lands.",
    "transform": "Motes whirl round the creature from its feet to its head and it changes in a flash.",
    "glimmer": "A small working: a glimmer in the caster's hand and a few motes.",
    "slash": "A blow lands: a crescent of light swept across the wound and sparks (claws, bites, blades)."
  },
  "_weapons": "Party weapon attacks: a slash on a melee hit, a shot for a ranged attack (an attack's own look comes from its option id).",
